pcbkit 1

// PCBKit on the silkscreen: the mark (the chip, its pin-1 dot cut out: brand/logo/mark-mono.svg)
// and pcbkit.io in the brand's Geist Pixel letters ("pcbkit" traced from the font,
// brand/src/build.mjs; "." and "o" on the same grid), set as the lockup sets them (a chip cell is
// two font pixels), one font pixel 0.32 mm: 41.6 x 7.36 mm. A part with nothing to
// solder: the placer finds it room where the design gives it no `at`.

